---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="使用教程 - 全平台客户端配置指南" 
  description="为您提供最新、最全的翻墙机场使用教程，涵盖 Windows, macOS, iOS, Android 等全平台主流客户端的配置与使用方法。"
>
  <div class="page-shell guide-page">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <h1>🚀 新手使用与配置教程</h1>
      <p>无论您使用的是电脑、手机还是路由器，在这里您都能找到最详尽的图文配置指南，助您轻松连接，畅游世界。</p>
    </header>

    <!-- 全平台主流客户端配置（流量基石） -->
    <section class="tutorial-section">
      <div class="section-title-wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">全平台主流客户端配置（流量基石）</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">适合刚买完机场套餐，需要把订阅节点导入到手机或电脑客户端的用户。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tutorial-grid">
        
        <!-- Card 1: Clash Verge Rev -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon pc-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">Windows / macOS</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Clash Verge Rev 使用教程</h3>
            <p>Clash Verge Rev 是 Windows 和 macOS 用户最常用的代理客户端。内核强大，界面现代化。本教程适合导入机场订阅、选择节点、开启规则模式并测试节点延迟。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/clash-verge-rev/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Shadowrocket -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon ios-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">iPhone / iPad</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Shadowrocket 小火箭教程</h3>
            <p>Shadowrocket 是 iOS 苹果用户最常见、最好用的代理客户端。支持所有主流协议。本教程将教您如何配置订阅、开启代理并排查无法连接的问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/shadowrocket/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: v2rayN -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon win-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12H2"></path><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path><line x1="6" y1="16" x2="6.01" y2="16"></line><line x1="10" y1="16" x2="10.01" y2="16"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">Windows</span>
              <span class="tc-level">进阶</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>v2rayN 使用教程</h3>
            <p>v2rayN 是 Windows 平台上非常经典的 V2Ray、Trojan、Shadowsocks 代理工具。轻量且高效，本教程将指导您如何进行节点测速和真全局代理设置。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/v2rayn/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4: Clash for Android -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon android-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">Android</span>
              <span class="tc-level">入门</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>Clash for Android 教程</h3>
            <p>安卓手机最主流的代理软件。界面直观，分流规则强大。适合导入 Clash 订阅、快速切换节点、开启规则模式并解决无法联网的常见问题。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/clash-for-android/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5: OpenClash -->
        <div class="tutorial-card">
          <div class="tc-top">
            <div class="tc-icon router-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line><line x1="10" y1="18" x2="10.01" y2="18"></line><path d="M16.8 14a6 6 0 0 0-9.6 0"></path><path d="M20 14a9.98 9.98 0 0 0-16 0"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-meta">
              <span class="tc-platform">OpenWrt 路由器</span>
              <span class="tc-level tc-advanced">高阶</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-body">
            <h3>OpenClash 软路由教程</h3>
            <p>为家庭网络提供全屋翻墙服务。OpenClash 运行在 OpenWrt 系统上。本教程教您如何在软路由中配置代理，让全家所有设备（如电视、主机）无感科学上网。</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guide/openclash/" class="tc-btn">
            查看教程
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <style is:inline>
    .guide-page {
      padding-top: 60px;
      padding-bottom: 100px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .guide-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 70px;
    }
    .guide-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .guide-header p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .tutorial-section {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .section-title-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 50px;
      border-left: 6px solid #3b82f6;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .tutorial-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .tutorial-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .tutorial-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .tc-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .tc-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .tc-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
    }
    .pc-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3); }
    .ios-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3); }
    .win-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3); }
    .android-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
    .router-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }

    .tc-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .tc-platform {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .tc-level {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #10b981;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      align-self: flex-start;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .tc-advanced {
      color: #f59e0b;
      background: #fffbeb;
    }

    .tc-body {
      flex-grow: 1;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .tc-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .tc-body p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .tc-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #3b82f6;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .tc-btn svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .tutorial-card:hover .tc-btn {
      background: #3b82f6;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }
    .tutorial-card:hover .tc-btn svg {
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .guide-header h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }
      .tutorial-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .tutorial-card {
        padding: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
